WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.914
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:24.485
I'm a cottontail rabbit.

3
00:00:24.486 --> 00:00:30.635
Cottontails are mammals with long ears.

4
00:00:30.636 --> 00:00:33.565
Where do you live?

5
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:39.149
Cottontails live in North and South America.

6
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:45.333
We like open fields and meadows.

7
00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:48.519
What do you eat?

8
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:53.947
Cottontails mostly eat grasses and herbs.

9
00:00:53.948 --> 00:01:01.027
We love vegetables like lettuce and peas!

10
00:01:01.028 --> 00:01:04.079
When do you eat?

11
00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.289
We eat after the sun goes down.

12
00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:15.572
That keeps us safe from enemies.

13
00:01:15.573 --> 00:01:20.003
Do you have many enemies?

14
00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:26.102
Yes, cottontails have a lot of enemies!

15
00:01:26.103 --> 00:01:32.213
Owls, hawks, and foxes often hunt us.

16
00:01:32.214 --> 00:01:39.402
But we can run away very fast!

17
00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:46.875
Your tail is so cute!

18
00:01:46.876 --> 00:01:51.692
Cottontails have brown or gray fur.

19
00:01:51.693 --> 00:01:57.361
But we all have the same kind of tail.

20
00:01:57.362 --> 00:02:05.394
It looks like a white cotton ball!

21
00:02:05.395 --> 00:02:09.989
Are those your babies?

22
00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:15.740
Yes. We make shallow nests underground.

23
00:02:15.741 --> 00:02:21.601
Our babies are very tiny when they're born.

24
00:02:21.602 --> 00:02:30.091
Many babies do not survive.

25
00:02:30.092 --> 00:02:34.271
I'm going back into the nest now.

26
00:02:34.272 --> 00:02:39.731
Good-bye!

27
00:02:39.732 --> 00:02:46.024
Bye, Cottontail Rabbit!
